e the) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0373  Tc 0.3855  Tw (talks process and to commit all our energies to achieving lasting peace and stability based on) TjT* 0.0229  Tc 0.5229  Tw (an agreement that has the loyalty of both sections of our community.) TjETBT0.5754 0 0 0.9939 79.92 660.96  Tm/F1 14  Tf-0.1404  Tc 0.7292  Tw (. . .) TjETBT0.9571 0 0 0.9939 97.44 660.96  Tm/F0 14  Tf-0.0596  Tc 5.9474  Tw (REAL REPRESENTATION) TjETBT0.9835 0 0 0.9835 78.72 636.96  Tm/F1 10  Tf0.0362  Tc 2.5911  Tw (The SDLP provides effective representation, a solid constituency service and a range of) Tj0.4881 -11.7137  TD 0.0375  Tc 2.1099  Tw (policies designed to meet the needs and concerns of our people. The Party stands on a) Tj0 -11.4697  TD 0.0311  Tc 0.7864  Tw (record of positive representation whether in local councils, the Parliaments in Westminster or) Tj-0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.0358  Tc 0.4156  Tw (Strasbourg or within the circles of power and influence in Washington and Brussels.) Tj0 -22.6953  TD 0.0321  Tc 0.5273  Tw (The public face of our constituency efforts are our MPs, John Hume in ) TjETq 26.16 0 0 -9.36 396 587.52 cm BI/F /A85 /W 109/H 39/BPC 1/D [ 1 0 ] /CS /GIDz!!%6DzzzrVuouzz!!*$!zzz++O=k!!!#7z!!!7Sz!8mhWz#J^<>!!!"<z!!!,:z
