nts views are not being) Tj-0.244 -11.9577  TD 0.0337  Tc 0.6229  Tw (systematically incorporated into the provision of Health and Social Care; money was) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0159  Tc 0.4968  Tw (supposed to follow the patient.) TjETBT0.778 0 0 0.9835 294.96 204.24  Tm/F0 10  Tf-0.0087  Tc 0  Tw (6) TjETendstreamendobj38 0 obj12017endobj36 0 obj<</MediaBox [ 0 0 610 1008 ]/Type /Page/Parent 5 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F0 6 0 R /F1 7 0 R /F2 13 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 37 0 R>>endobj43 0 obj<</Length 44 0 R>>stream
