 not prevent) Tj0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.022  Tc 2.0768  Tw (people taking up employment.) Tj150.814 0.4881  TD 0.0129  Tc 2.0861  Tw (In the view of the SDLP meeting the latter two objectives) Tj-150.814 -12.2018  TD 0.0306  Tc 1.411  Tw (means a minimum wage, a relationship between the tax system, the social security system) Tj-0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.0417  Tc 1.341  Tw (and the pricing policy in public services, such as public sector housing rents, that does not) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0357  Tc 0.2732  Tw (create a poverty trap.) Tj-0.244 -23.6715  TD /F0 10  Tf0.005  Tc 0.7344  Tw (The SDLP commits itself to support the ) TjETq 51.12 0 0 -9.6 263.52 682.08 cm BI/F /A85 /W 213/H 40/BPC 1/D [ 1 0 ] /CS /GIDzzzzz!'C5]zzzzz!!!!$s1eU7zzzzz!!!Q0n,NFgzzzzz!$D79zzzzzz5QCW]zzz
