3  Tc 1.1715  Tw (The SDLP is deeply concerned by the fact that after twenty years of sex discrimination and) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0332  Tc 1.3658  Tw (equal pay legislation there is still a need for a strong lobby on women\222s issues. Legislation) Tj0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.0312  Tc 3.7757  Tw (alone is not enough, and) Tj139.3443 0.244  TD 0.0214  Tc 4.4262  Tw (affirmative action is required to allow women equality of) Tj-139.5884 -11.9577  TD 0.0296  Tc 2.6304  Tw (opportunity in the job-market. Given that women are over-represented amongst part-time) Tj0 -11.4697  TD 0.0266  Tc 1.5841  Tw (and low-paid workers, we are particularly committed to arguing for the implementation of a) Tj0.244 -11.4697  TD 0.0219  Tc 0.5376  Tw (minimum wage and better childcare facilities to facilitate women wishing to train or work.) Tj-0.4881 -22.9394  TD 0.0306  Tc 1.7891  Tw (The SDLP is arguing for independent legal status for women married to working men and) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0275  Tc 1.0602  Tw (that strenuous efforts be made to rectify the other inequalities experienced by women in the) Tj0 -11.4697  TD 0.0233  Tc 0.9468  Tw (social security system. In terms of public life the Party believes that there will continue to be) Tj0.244 -11.2256  TD 0.0273  Tc 0.6246  Tw (a serious democratic deficit until women are enabled to take their positions and participate at) Tj-0.244 -11.4697  TD 0.0369  Tc 0.4483  Tw (all levels. We see these not just as women\222s issues but as society\222s issues. It is our view that) Tj0 -11.4697  TD 0.0353  Tc 1.9413  Tw (when women are enabled to contribute their talents and energies on an equal basis then) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0256  Tc 0.3649  Tw (society as a whole will benefit.) Tj0 -23.4274  TD /F0 10  Tf-0.0065  Tc 1.0076  Tw (The SDLP is campaigning for:) Tj0.9761 -25.1357  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0349  Tc 0.5995  Tw (A major overhaul of the law on sex discrimination and equal pay, to produce a single) Tj3.1725 -11.9577  TD 0.0342  Tc 0.6733  Tw (comprehensive piece of legislation, with simplified provisions on procedures, and reform) Tj0 -11.9577  TD 0.0289  Tc 0.4225  Tw (to allow case law to act to its full capacity in establishing policy on particular types of) TjETBT0.9398 0 0 0.9835 96.72 447.12  Tm0.0748  Tc 0  Tw (cases.) TjETBT0.9835 0 0 0.9835 83.28 423.36  Tm/F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.013  Tc 0.9268  Tw (The adoption of the Social Chapter, the implementation of a minimum wage and) Tj3.4165 -12.4458  TD 0.0353  Tc 0.294  Tw (guaranteed rights for all workers, regardless of contractual status.) Tj-13.91 -25.8678  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0268  Tc 0.7704  Tw (Better rights and conditions for all parents in the workforce.) Tj-10.4935 -26.3559  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0433  Tc 2.4212  Tw (Universally available childcare.) Tj-10.4935 -25.8678  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.033  Tc 0.7967  Tw (Increased confidence-building and training opportunities to be directed at women wishing) Tj3.1725 -12.6899  TD 0.0263  Tc 0.3642  Tw (to enter or re-enter the job-market.) Tj-13.666 -24.8916  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0333  Tc 0.3571  Tw (A co-ordinated ) TjETq 76.08 0 0 -9.6 162.48 304.8 cm BI/F /A85 /W 317/H 40/BPC 1/D [ 1 0 ] /CS /GIDzzzzzzzzz!!)cozzzzzzzzz!!iOSzzzzzzzzz!"]+Fzzzzzzzzz!$D7!zzzzzzzz
