ing for:) Tj0.9761 -23.9155  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0316  Tc 0.7045  Tw (An immediate increase in pensions, and a government commitment to assess the needs) Tj3.1725 -12.6899  TD 0.0271  Tc 0.3634  Tw (of senior citizens and abolish age-limits on benefits.) Tj-13.666 -25.1357  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0131  Tc 0.7531  Tw (An end to VAT on heating fuel, and in the interim, exemption for pensioners.) Tj-10.4935 -26.1118  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0348  Tc 0.8088  Tw (High quality health-care provided free to all pensioners.) Tj-10.4935 -26.1118  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0451  Tc 0.6937  Tw (Free travel passes and television licenses for pensioners.) Tj3.1725 -38.8017  TD 0.0304  Tc 0.4211  Tw (to disconnect the telephone or electricity supply of pensioners without getting a court) TjETBT0.9398 0 0 0.9835 99.6 546  Tm0.0277  Tc 0  Tw (order.) TjETBT0.9835 0 0 0.9835 86.16 521.28  Tm/F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.2495 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.046  Tc 0.4994  Tw (Free security chains, door and window locks and alarms for senior citizens.) Tj-10.0055 -26.1118  TD /F2 10  Tf-0.0491  Tc -0.0472  Tw (n ) Tj10.4935 0  TD /F1 10  Tf0.0331  Tc 0.6764  Tw (Training schemes for people of all ages, and new legal provisions to outlaw discrimination) Tj3.6605 -12.4458  TD 0.0311  Tc 0.2373  Tw (in the job-market solely on the grounds of age.) Tj-0.4881 -38.3136  TD 0.0275  Tc 0.4036  Tw (claiming all the money they are owed.) TjETBT0.716 0 0 0.9835 290.4 200.88  Tm0.3035  Tc 0  Tw (12) TjETendstreamendobj92 0 obj3726endobj82 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 40 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F0 6 0 R /F1 7 0 R /F2 13 0 R >>/XObject <</im10 83 0 R /im11 87 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents [ 85 0 R 89 0 R 91 0 R  ]>>endobj97 0 obj<</Length 98 0 R>>