and. Since our inception we have campaigned on this basis and we have argued for a) Tj-0.9761 -11.7137  TD 0.0144  Tc 2.3448  Tw (fresh initiative, a settlement that would place respect for the rights of all traditions at the) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0269  Tc 2.4226  Tw (centres of power in our society, and uphold the right to participate of all sections of the) Tj0.244 -11.9577  TD 0.0266  Tc 3.699  Tw (population. We want to see an end to the culture of fear and domination which has) Tj-0.244 -11.2256  TD 0.0429  Tc 1.2624  Tw (oppressed every individual during these last decades. We are convinced that upholding the) Tj0.4881 -11.2256  TD 0.0276  Tc 2.8176  Tw (rights of all sections of the community is the way to a just and lasting peace. We are) Tj-0.4881 -11.7137  TD 0.0218  Tc 3.332  Tw (confident that on this foundation we can negotiate an agreement for a new Ireland, a) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0202  Tc 1.8346  Tw (settlement that would be reinforced by the support it would attract from all sections of the) Tj0 -11.9577  TD 0.0246  Tc 0.9545  Tw (population north and south. The incorporation of a bill of rights must be a key aspect of that) Tj-0.244 -11.2256  TD 0.0402  Tc 0.4043  Tw (agreement, as well as a representative and accountable police service.) Tj0 -23.1834  TD 0.0436  Tc 2.7869  Tw (We have long argued against violence, repression and harassment from all quarters as) Tj0 -11.9577  TD 0.0313  Tc 1.4573  Tw (totally unjustified and counter-productive. This society has seen the proof that violence and) Tj0.4881 -11.4697  TD 0.0359  Tc 2.8297  Tw (repression - from the worst aspects of an unjust criminal justice system, to the horrors) Tj-0.244 -11.9577  TD 0.0272  Tc 1.1128  Tw (inflicted by the paramilitaries - bring only further conflict in their wake. The ongoing violence) Tj0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.0409  Tc 0.5934  Tw (is used an excuse not to negotiate while the lack of progress allows paramilitaries an excuse) Tj0 -11.4697  TD 0.0357  Tc 0.3872  Tw (not to call a cease-fire. We must have a cease-fire and we must have serious negotiations.) Tj-0.4881 -23.4274  TD 0.0425  Tc 1.4916  Tw (While persevering in our work to bring about peace and in our efforts to make progress in) Tj0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.0207  Tc 3.3546  Tw (negotiations we will continue campaigning for the victims of injustice, for the repeal of) Tj-0.244 -11.9577  TD 0.0297  Tc 1.3857  Tw (emergency legislation, and for the transfer of prisoners. The SDLP is proud of its record of) Tj0 -11.7137  TD 0.0266  Tc 0.6892  Tw (active representation of our constituents, and of the influence that we exercise at all levels of) TjT* 0.0368  Tc 0  Tw (decision-making.) Tj-0.244 -23.4274  TD 0.0348  Tc 0.6453  Tw (The events of last Summer have served to increase the concerns of the SDLP with regard to) Tj0.244 -12.2018  TD 0.0242  Tc 1.6475  Tw (policing in our community. Yet again nationalists witnessed their rights violated, their views) Tj0.244 -11.4697  TD 0.0153  Tc 0.8147  Tw (ignored, their freedom curtailed, and all of this justified in the language of \221rights\222. With public) Tj-0.4881 -11.7137  TD 0.0244  Tc 2.1494  Tw (confidence in policing at an all-time low, the argument for piecemeal reform is thoroughly) Tj0 -11.9577  TD 0.0278  Tc 0  Tw (discredited.) Tj-0.244 -23.1834  TD 0.0279  Tc 0.9901  Tw (The SDLP fully appreciates the complexity of the parades issue in both political and policing) Tj0.244 -11.9577  TD 0.0217  Tc 1.0138  Tw (terms. Rights entail responsibilities. The problem arises out of two sets of competing but not) Tj0.4881 -11.7137  TD 0.0292  Tc 4.6318  Tw (irreconcilable rights: the) Tj-0.244 -11.7137  TD 0.01  Tc 2.6991  Tw (movement, freedom from) Tj123.7261 12.2018  TD 0.261  Tc 3.054  Tw (right to freedom of expression and the right to freedom of) Tj-1.7082 -11.7137  TD 0.0194  Tc 1.9168  Tw (terror, intimidation and domination. Our concern is not to exploit) TjETBT0.7347 0 0 0.9835 288.72 205.68 